<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38277" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαπο-στέλλω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>send after,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γράμματα ἐπαπεστάλη αὐτοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					31.2.14
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. στρατηγὸν ἕτερον</span>
			<i>send</i> another general <i>after him</i> (to supersede him),
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.15.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>send to attack,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				32.5.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινάς τισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.8.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συκοφάντην ἐπί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					12.24
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jb.</u>
				20.23
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
